oose Me, or Someone else for a family member or friend: add their full name, email, phone and date of birth. They are the main driver: they get their own link to add their licence and a selfie and to sign the rental agreement (the main driver needs an Ontario licence). You sign too.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Add a Note (optional) for our team.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">5</span><div class="gd-t">Tick that you are responsible for the booking: the deductible ($2,500) and any damage, tickets, tolls and fees during it are billed to you, whoever drives, each with its evidence.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">6</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Book my car</b>.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/owner/bookings</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:450/570"><img src="/guides/img/owner-04-calendar-desktop-a4500851.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="450" height="570"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:92.2%;top:14.6%" aria-hidden="true">2</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:92.2%;top:64.9%" aria-hidden="true">3</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:42.2%;top:89.6%" aria-hidden="true">4</span></div></div></figure></div><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Good to know</span><div>An owner booking earns no revenue and is not on your statement. No price and no deposit apply to you. One booking can be 30 days at most, and you sign the rental agreement before pickup.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="bookings-and-your-own-use-rideshare-and-repeat-renters-release-35" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Rideshare and repeat renters (release 35)</h2><p class="gd-p">Renters may drive for rideshare and delivery platforms with the documents we issue. Verified repeat renters can book you