>The lanes show what Finance handles: payments to fix, refunds waiting, tolls and tickets, deposits to settle and owner statements. Money today counts them below.</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="finance-payments-by-day" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Payments by day</h2><p class="gd-p"><b class="gd-ui">Money</b>, the <b class="gd-ui">By day</b> tab, is your day in one screen: every payment and refund, by method, with the cash drawer and the refunds to decide.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Choose From and To (today by default) and tick the methods you want (card, e-Transfer, cash, cheque, platform payout, insurer and others; none ticked shows all), then press <b class="gd-ui">Show</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Totals by method: received, refunded and net. Each day: the same by method, the cash expected in the drawer (cash received less cash given back) and the cash counted.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">At the end of the day count the drawer and press <b class="gd-ui">Record the count</b>. The difference shows &quot;balanced&quot;, or &quot;over&quot; or &quot;short&quot; with the amount.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Refunds waiting: every refund asked for anywhere (a cancellation, a booking, Finance), with the policy maths (paid, the tier, the percentage back, what is kept). Press <b class="gd-ui">Approve</b> or <b class="gd-ui">Decline</b> with the reason in the same row; above your limit it says an Admin approves. Approved: <b class="gd-ui">Issue the refund</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">5</span><div class="gd-t"><b class="gd-ui">Export CSV</b> gives the same rows for the bank or the bookkeeper: refunds as negative amounts, holds marked as not money in.</div></li></ol></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="finance-payments-deposits-refunds" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Payments, deposits, refunds</h2><p class="gd-p"><b class="gd-ui">Money</b>, the <b class="gd-ui">To handle</b> tab.</p><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Failed payments: each with the purpose, amount and the bank&#39;s reason.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Deposits to take before pickup, and deposits due back.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Refunds in progress. Press <b class="gd-ui">Request the refund</b> and choose What it refunds (the rental charge, delivery or pickup, kilometres, add-ons or other charges); above your limit it waits for an Admin. Then <b class="gd-ui">Issue the refund</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Owner invoices that failed, and owner statements to prepare.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/va/money</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:1230/865"><img src="/guides/img/va-finance-02-money-desktop-486a8fbc.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1230" height="865"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:10.6%;top:60.3%" aria-hidden="true">1</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:72.4%;top:21.6%" aria-hidden="true">2</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:73.2%;top:33.8%" aria-hidden="true">3</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:11%;top:45.9%" aria-hidden="true">4</span></div></div></figure></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="finance-a-payment-received-another-way" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">A payment received another way</h2><p class="gd-p">An owner or renter paid by e-Transfer, cheque, cash or bank trans